  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAssetsAndLiabilitiesIncurredFromTransactionsWithAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;※１　関係会社に対する金銭債権及び金銭債務&lt;/p&gt;
